mTTc/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEcCNACELwBSFXyq4qpAw4IARUAAIhCGAFwAcABBg==&rs=AOn4CLAJvEnyirmHpar_XGo6P--F9ackpg","durationSeconds":1017,"views":2166,"likes":46,"publishedAt":"2026-08-11T00:03:17Z","channelId":"UCLKPca3kwwd-B59HNr-_lvA","tags":["Conferences"],"accent":"#51525a","available":true,"companyId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-11T15:54:18.154Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-23T11:49:04.544Z","author":{"name":"AI Engineer","avatar":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/ajVemEB89DAOemsbfuMY6ZOWXJAACx3cbty9z21jeqRKODaVkDBSRun1b1xfQJljEsziOWS_Mg=s0"}},{"id":"128d417be66d49079c8c261d4a582cae","slug":"culture-chatgpt-ep-88-did-tiktok-ruin-music-tory-lanez-diddy-yg-vs-the-game","title":"Culture ChatGPT EP 88 | Did TikTok Ruin Music? Tory Lanez, Diddy, YG vs The Game 💬","description":"🎙️ Culture ChatGPT EP 88 | Did TikTok Ruin Music? Tory Lanez Diddy, Future & VERZUZ Did TikTok and social media ruin the way we listen to music, or did the music industry just learn how to play the game?  Episode 88 starts with a look behind the curtain at the music A&R process, how records get picked, and whether Gen Z’s attention span has forced artists to make shorter songs, faster hooks, and music built for clips instead of full projects. That leads into the bigger question: Did TikTok help the music business or mess the game up?  From there, BL, Che Mack, and Don McGhee get into Tory Lanez, Diddy, dating stories that probably should’ve stayed private 😂, and another round of ChatGPT Chad before bringing it back to the music.  The crew gets into Future and 808 Mafia, Young Chris, and a potential YG vs. The Game VERZUZ before debating some of the best VERZUZ matchups we’ve seen and who still needs to step into the ring.  It’s music industry talk, hip-hop debates, jokes, bad dates, questionable takes, and enough disagreement to keep the comments busy. 💬  🎧 Tap in, subscribe and Get In The Chat 💬  Question: Did TikTok make music better, or did it teach artists to make songs for 15-second attention spans? 💬  #CultureChatGPT #CCGPT #LetsChatCulture #GetInTheChat 💬 #TikTok #HipHop #MusicIndustry #ToryLanez #Diddy #Future #808Mafia #YG #TheGame #VERZUZ #HipHopCulture #RapCulture #BlackPodcast #MusicPodcast 💬","toolName":"Culture ChatGPT","toolCategory":"llm","youtubeId":"-7GXvl7LeLo","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-7GXvl7LeLo/hqdefault.jpg","durationSeconds":3011,"views":186,"likes":9,"publishedAt":"2026-08-11","channelId":null,"tags":["podcasts"],"accent":"#5e6ad2","available":true,"companyId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-28T08:46:22.860Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-28T08:46:22.860Z","author":{"name":"Culture ChatGPT","avatar":"https://ui-avatars.com/api/?name=CU&background=random"}},{"id":"cmsyqoq2k0037psp7fi3to204","slug":"can-an-ai-be-investigated-like-2NgfLd","title":"Can an AI Be Investigated Like an Accomplice?","description":"Live aggregated review content.","toolName":"General AI Tools","toolCategory":"general-ai","youtubeId":"2NgfLdUE3vM","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2NgfLdUE3vM/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEcCNAFEJQDSFXyq4qpAw4IARUAAIhCGAFwAcABBg==&rs=AOn4CLBV7A1AYyDUjQ2CrwjOS0AkckGCEw","durationSeconds":915,"views":3028,"likes":98,"publishedAt":"2026-08-10T23:26:58Z","channelId":"UCUTF61UNExRdjmoK5mXwWfQ","tags":["Educational Content"],"accent":"#51525a","available":true,"companyId":null,"createdAt":"2026-08-18T14:09:49.052Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-27T04:11:36.914Z","author":{"name":"AI Uncovered","avatar":"https://yt3.googleusercontent.com/fg8cytn5PP5CffNFbC9lQBODqi0ubkOPotNCib4FS8t13j4rhsclwGMpZOH2LdLGO59wQM7KU-Q=s0"}},{"id":"cmt5xln9r001npsp76f4sdtcj","slug":"ai-is-learning-at-the-wrong-le-revreN","title":"AI Is Learning at the Wrong Level of Abstraction — Matthieu Wyart","description":"Live aggregated review content.","toolName":"General AI Tools","toolCategory":"general-ai","youtubeId":"revreN8LZ_M","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/revreN8LZ_M/hq720.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEcCNAFEJQDSFXyq4qpAw4IARUAAIhCGAFwAcABBg==&rs=AOn4CLD-5ro_E4Kxt0LSr6etQeiu8MOVDQ","durationSec